The leather shop, a new shop type, contains exclusively leather objects:
leather jackets, armor, helms, gloves, drums, saddles, leashes, slings,
whips, spellbooks, and anything else I might have forgotten.  +1 charisma
bonus (as viewed by the shopkeeper) if you are wearing any of these items;
or if you are a valkyrie or barbarian.  Shop might also contain scrolls of
punishment, maybe some iron chains lying around.  Succubi or incubi are
always friendly when in a shop. 


